headers.env:
ARG DAGU_VERSION (default 2.15.3, also re-exposed as ENV for the entrypoint script to read);
ENV PATH (prepends /root/.ci-tools/bin), DAGU_HOME, DAGU_PORT, DAGU_AUTH_MODE (all fixed, not
caller-overridable at build time).

headers.uses:
Node's fs module; ../_helpers (test, screenshot, downloadPng, closeNotification,
assertCardHasText, assertOverlayHasText, assertComputedColor, assertRightAligned);
./attachment.flow, ./category.flow, ./city.flow, ./entity-activity.flow.
